        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The plans below show a student common room five years ago and the common room now. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "description": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VR4Bdnwv2oOB3kxiEG7lkwX1ghh\"><strong><em>The plans below show a student common room five years ago and the common room now. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</em></strong></div>\n</div>",
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Student Room: 5 Years Ago vs Now</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Student Room: 5 Years Ago vs Now y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về bản vẽ ph&ograve;ng sinh hoạt chung của sinh vi&ecirc;n c&aacute;ch đ&acirc;y năm năm v&agrave; ph&ograve;ng sinh hoạt chung ở thời điểm hiện tại.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Student Room: 5 Years Ago vs Now với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: những thay đổi đ&atilde; diễn ra trong ph&ograve;ng sinh hoạt chung của sinh vi&ecirc;n - so s&aacute;nh bố cục từ năm năm trước với hiện tại.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>,&nbsp;với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZdNdn58xo1DePxzr3CldmTZgch\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ph&ograve;ng sinh hoạt chung đ&atilde; trải qua<strong> qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh hiện đại h&oacute;a đ&aacute;ng kể </strong><em>(undergone significant modernization)</em>, với việc bổ sung <strong>nhiều cơ sở tiện &iacute;ch giải tr&iacute;</strong> <em>(recreational facilities)</em> v&agrave; giảm bớt nội thất học tập truyền thống.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YrsZdcaVdo9kuExrx6GlVa8Ogce\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Kh&ocirc;ng gian đ&atilde; được biến đổi từ <strong>một m&ocirc;i trường thuần t&uacute;y học thuật </strong><em>(purely academic environment)</em> th&agrave;nh một <strong>khu vực linh hoạt </strong><em>(versatile area)</em> hơn,<strong> đ&aacute;p ứng </strong><em>(accommodates)</em> cả nhu cầu học tập lẫn giải tr&iacute;.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c chi tiết dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; về <strong>t&iacute;nh chất sử dụng đất</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c thay đổi về vị tr&iacute; nội thất (furniture)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NyZkdJIdqordWLxHdWolzvIygLh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>thay đổi đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; nhất</strong><em> (notable change) </em>l&agrave; việc giảm<strong> sức chứa chỗ ngồi</strong> <em>(seating capacity) </em>d&agrave;nh cho học tập.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FW7hdXj3coU2R0xXTXtlLB46gVh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Năm năm trước, căn ph&ograve;ng c&oacute; bốn b&agrave;n tr&ograve;n lớn <strong>được ph&acirc;n bố đều </strong><em>(distributed evenly)</em> khắp kh&ocirc;ng gian, mỗi b&agrave;n đều được bao quanh bởi c&aacute;c ghế nhỏ.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZnX6dAxUEoHDEJxjWrTldAIogeb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Hiện tại, chỉ c&ograve;n lại hai b&agrave;n, được đặt ở trung t&acirc;m v&agrave; g&oacute;c dưới b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i của căn ph&ograve;ng. Cửa ra v&agrave;o, vốn trước đ&acirc;y nằm ở ph&iacute;a b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i, <strong>đ&atilde; được chuyển l&ecirc;n</strong> <em>(be relocated to)</em> ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n căn ph&ograve;ng,cải thiện <strong>khả năng tiếp cận</strong> <em>(accessibility)</em> v&agrave; luồng di chuyển.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c bổ sung của nhiều tiện nghi mới (<em>modern amenities</em>)</strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QyQodgEOhoXShpx5DiHlySGigNK\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>X&eacute;t về<strong> những bổ sung mới </strong><em>(new additions), </em>nhiều <strong>tiện nghi hiện đại </strong><em>(modern amenities) </em>đ&atilde; được đưa v&agrave;o để <strong>n&acirc;ng cao</strong><em> (accommodate)</em> trải nghiệm học tập kh&aacute;c nhau của sinh vi&ecirc;n.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXWndmoYhoJyvLxXdlblkp71gJg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Một gi&aacute; s&aacute;ch cao<strong> đ&atilde; được lắp</strong> <em>(has been installed)</em> dọc bức tường b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i,<strong> cung cấp nơi lưu trữ</strong> <em>(convenient storage)</em> v&agrave; t&agrave;i liệu học tập.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXWndmoYhoJyvLxXdlblkp71gJg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ngo&agrave;i ra, b&ecirc;n phải căn ph&ograve;ng c&oacute; những chiếc ghế b&agrave;nh xanh l&aacute; được xếp gần tivi, tạo th&agrave;nh khu vực <strong>d&agrave;nh ri&ecirc;ng cho</strong> <em>(dedicated to)</em> thư gi&atilde;n v&agrave; giải tr&iacute;.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXWndmoYhoJyvLxXdlblkp71gJg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Một băng ghế cam&nbsp;<strong>thiết kế đặc biệt cho</strong> <em>(specifically designed for)</em>&nbsp;laptop được <strong>bố tr&iacute; một c&aacute;ch chiến lược </strong><em>(strategically positioned),</em> phản &aacute;nh tầm quan trọng của&nbsp;<strong>việc học tập kỹ thuật số</strong><em> (digital learning)</em> trong nền gi&aacute;o dục hiện đại.<strong> </strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2028,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4IZdDSv1og7lexyjQOljOf2g9d\">The plans illustrate the changes in a student common room over a five-year period, comparing the layout from five years ago to the present day.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18751,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2029,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overall",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PGJOdfN3FovoG8x1vRCl0f5ZgQb\">Overall, the common room has undergone significant modernization, with the addition of various recreational facilities and a reduction in traditional study furniture. The space has been transformed from a purely academic environment to a more versatile area that accommodates both studying and leisure activities.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18751,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2030,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5z7d5pOLoMfxvxgh4ul1cYPgle\">Regarding the furniture arrangement, the most notable change is the reduction in seating capacity for studying. Five years ago, the room contained four large circular tables distributed evenly throughout the space, with each table surrounded by small seats. Currently, only two tables remain, positioned in the center and lower left area of the room. The entrance, which was previously located on the left side, has been relocated to the top of the room, improving accessibility and flow.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18751,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2031,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ArefdeWOCodJWZxtVsll2DlrgNg\">In terms of new additions, several modern amenities have been introduced to enhance the student experience and accommodate diverse learning preferences. A tall bookshelf has been installed along the left wall, providing convenient storage and study resources for students. Additionally, the right side of the room now features comfortable green armchairs arranged near a television, creating a dedicated relaxation and entertainment zone. Furthermore, an orange bench specifically designed for laptop use has been strategically positioned, reflecting the growing importance of digital learning in modern education.</div>\n</div>",
